                  ( Nucleus (span 8 9) (rel2par joint-list)
                    ( Nucleus (leaf 8) (rel2par span) (text _!Like many mothers , Kristen went all out for the party ._!) )
                    ( Satellite (leaf 9) (rel2par explanation-evidence) (text _!She had a face painting station , a hot dog bar , entertainers , props and backdrops for photos , and even a bounce house outside of the party ._!) )
