              ( Satellite (span 26 27) (rel2par context-background)
                ( Nucleus (leaf 26) (rel2par span) (text _!Mariah Dodds , a longtime friend of Kristen 's , and her three children , Jayden , Zane , and Alanah Phillips had just sat down at a table_!) )
                ( Satellite (leaf 27) (rel2par purpose-goal) (text _!to enjoy their lunch from the party 's hot dog bar ._!) )
